    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Overview\nWhen webhook receives abandoned cart, this workflow recovers it with tiered discounts:\n\n1. Normalize session and cart fields\n2. Calculate item totals and cart total\n3. Route cart by value into 4 tiers\n4. Log to Google Sheets with priority tag\n5. Send matching discount email via Gmail\n6. End flow with NoOp",
        "height": 408,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "1704eaab-9ed9-4d44-8020-f328a3235b4c",
      "name": "Note: Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -2592,
        1648
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Node-by-node Purpose\n\n1. Webhook\nReceives POST cart_finalized event with items and user email\n\n2. Edit Fields\nExtracts session_id, user_email, sent_at, items\n\n3. Total amount calculate\nCalculates price x quantity per item and total cart value\n\n4. Filter Cart Value Range\nRoutes cart to 4 tiers based on total value\n\n5. Log Low Priority Cart\nLogs carts under 25000 to Sheets as Low\n\n6. Send Upsell Discount Email\nSends 10 percent upsell email to reach 25000 threshold\n\n7. No Operation do nothing\nEnd step for low tier\n\n8. Log Medium Priority Cart\nLogs 25000 to 49999 carts as Medium\n\n9. Send 20 percent Discount Email\nSends 20 percent off email with 2 day urgency\n\n10. No Operation do nothing1\nEnd step for medium tier\n\n11. No Operation do nothing2\nEnd step for high tier\n\n12. Log High Priority Cart\nLogs 50000 to 100000 carts as High\n\n13. Send 30 percent Discount Email\nSends 30 percent VIP email\n\n14. No Operation do nothing3\nEnd step for VIP tier\n\n15. Log VIP Priority Cart\nLogs carts over 100000 as vip\n\n16. Send 40 percent Discount Email\nSends 40 percent top VIP reward email",
        "height": 868,
        "width": 488,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "e0361218-e84d-4cdc-a0b9-508b913e6330",
      "name": "Note: Node-by-node",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -320,
        1520
      ]
    }
